  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5505.03 Removal from Public List.\n\n(a) Pursuant to RSA 651-B:6, III, upon receipt of a certified copy of a court's order authorizing the removal of a sexual offender or offender against children from the public list, the department shall remove the sexual offender or offender against children's information, as set forth in Saf-C 5505.01 above, from the list.\n\n(b) Nothing in this section shall relieve a sexual offender or offender against children of obligation to register as set forth in RSA 651-B:6.\n\nSource. #5537, eff 1-1-93; ss by #6314, EMERGENCY eff 8-9-96, EXPIRES: 12-7-96; ss by #6324, INTERIM eff 8-22-96, EXPIRES: 12-20-96; ss by #6358, eff 10-22-96; ss by #6919, INTERIM, eff 1-1-99, EXPIRES: 5-1-99; ss by #6990, EMERGENCY, eff 4-30-99, EXPIRES: 8-28-99; ss by #7066, eff 7-28-99; ss by #7982, INTERIM eff 10-30-03, EXPIRED: 4-27-04\n\nNew. #8083, eff 5-11-04; ss by #10121, eff 4-25-12; ss by #13504, eff 12-9-22",
